{
  "category": "Intertwining Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It sends a soothing aura from its ribbonlike feelers to calm fights.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It wraps its ribbonlike feelers around the arm of its beloved Trainer and walks with him or her.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sends a soothing aura from its ribbonlike feelers to calm fights.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It wraps its ribbonlike feelers around the arm of its beloved Trainer and walks with him or her.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its ribbonlike feelers give off an aura that weakens hostility in its prey, causing them to let down their guard. Then it attacks.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "When this Pokémon sights its prey, it swirls its ribbonlike feelers as a distraction. A moment later, it pounces.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once a fight breaks out, it will unflinchingly charge at dragon Pokémon that are many times larger than itself.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sylveon wraps its ribbonlike feelers around its Trainer’s arm because this touch enables it to read its Trainer’s feelings.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "By releasing enmity-erasing waves from its ribbonlike feelers, Sylveon stops any conflict.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "There’s a Galarian fairy tale that describes a beautiful Sylveon vanquishing a dreadful dragon Pokémon.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "It emits a soothing aura from its ribbon-shaped organs. It wraps these appendages around quarrelers to instantly restore calm to the situation.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
